    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d329">

                <pb facs="0534" n="390" xml:id="pg390"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77 Chinese Eastern/587: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Albania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Holmes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-12-05T10:00:00+01:00">December 5, 1929—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:09 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>40. Department’s circular telegram December 1 [, 4 p.m.]. Foreign Minister has
                    given me oral assurance that Albania will immediately comply.<anchor n="68"
                        xml:id="d329-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Holmes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
